# Host-framework build output. `dist/` above covers the bundlers that use it;
# these name their own, and a gate that walks the tree would otherwise check a
# generated `$d$id` folder against the naming canon. `.nuxt/` is not output but
# the type shims Nuxt generates for its auto-imports, and `.svelte-kit/` is the
# same for Kit — its tsconfig, its `$types` and its `$app` modules. Both are the
# same kind of thing: written by a tool, read by a typecheck, owned by nobody here.
.next/
.astro/
.expo/
.nuxt/
.output/
.svelte-kit/
